{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/990613-what-do-onyxpath-gm-screens-usually-look-like","id":990613,"title":"What do Onyxpath GM Screens usually look like?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scion"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-10-20T13:56:58-07:00","id":990613,"title":"What do Onyxpath GM Screens usually look like?","content":"I am considering adding a GM Screen to my Scion Kickstarter pledge but I have never backed a Onyxpath project with a GM Screen before so I don't really have a reference for what they usually look like. Are their Screens more mechanics and stats focused, or do they have things like NPC and locations tables? I prefer a GM Screen that is purely stats, rules, and mechanics focused. I want it to be entirely about saving me from having to look things up in the book.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5622-sprucestripedgoose","name":"SpruceStripedGoose","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5622_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"394"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-20T14:42:04-07:00","id":990638,"title":"","content":"We try to look at it from the game runner's point of view and provide a selection of charts and tables for easy reference that you would need in a typical night's gameplay.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5-richt","name":"RichT","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5_2.jpeg","title":"Onyx Path Creative Director","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"505"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-20T14:42:57-07:00","id":990639,"title":"","content":"They're usually the most important rules and stats for the main weapon classes, similar to Savage Worlds ones, if you've used them, i.e. the kind you want.<br /> <br /> EDIT: RichT said it better, I suspect he has insider knowledge on these things.<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3326-an-fhuiseog","name":"An Fhuiseog","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3326_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"271"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-20T17:44:45-07:00","id":990712,"title":"","content":"Can you buy game screens outside of a Kickstarter ?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":3950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","user":"wonderandawe","date":".  Autocorrect fail 10-20-2016, 08:45 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-24T09:57:30-07:00","id":992436,"title":"","content":"Short answer: no, you can't get a screen outside of a Kickstarter.<br /> <br /> Explanation/Long answer: Right now, DTRPG doesn't have the ability to print the actual screens. However, they do offer Hammerdog's The World's Greatest Screen which is a customizable GM screen (four panels on each side). I know that the PDF of the Character Sheet pads for <i>New World of Darkness</i> (1st edition) usually had the screens available for print and I have PDFs for <i>Demon</i> and <i>Requiem</i> 2nd edition. I haven't seen any for the newer 2nd edition games, sadly.<br /> <br /> <br /> If you decide to buy one of those screens, I suggest you buy it direct from <a href=\"http://hammerdog.com/twgs/\" target=\"_blank\">Hammerdog</a>. DTRPG wanted over $16 for shipping. Hammerdog charges a flat $5.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;The Man and the Beast are having an amiable picnic in that Savage\u2019s head. It\u2019s rather disturbing.&quot; <i>- Blood and Smoke: the Strix Chronicle, pg. 22</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/145-jsm3050","name":"JSM3050","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar145_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"45"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}